# Maven Central answers 429 (Too Many Requests) when many builds share an address, as CI runners and the image
# builds in the compatibility gate do. Maven retries a 429 or 503 three times, 5 s apart and backing off, by default:
# about half a minute, which a busy minute outlasts. Retry eight times from 10 s, backing off up to 2 minutes apart.
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.count=8
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.interval=10000
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.intervalMax=120000
